{"3391940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Samurai Stratagem", "steam_appid": 3391940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lone samurai, consumed by grief and vengeance, walks the path of blood.</strong> His wife—murdered. His daughter—taken. With nothing left but his blade and a burning will to strike down injustice, he races through the shadows of feudal Japan, hunting those who shattered his world. Each duel is a test of speed, precision, and nerve. There are no second chances. Only the clash of steel and the silence that follows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Samurai Stratagem </strong>is a fast-paced, twitch-reflex action game where every input is a strike, every mistake a wound. Face five deadly samurai in one-on-one battles, each more brutal than the last. React to directional prompts, dodge feints, master holds and double taps, and unleash flawless combos to carve your revenge into the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning-Fast Combat</strong> – Input-based duels that demand razor-sharp reflexes and total focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Pixel Art Style</strong> – Clean visuals with cinematic flair, inspired by classic samurai showdowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Encounters</strong> – One mistake can cost everything. Blood sprays, sparks fly, and tension builds with every clash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score-Based Arcade Mode</strong> – Chase perfection, climb the leaderboard, and prove your mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Replayable Campaign</strong> – Five intense battles. One path to vengeance. How fast can you finish it?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No rhythm. No mercy. Just you, your blade, and the speed of your mind.</strong> Are you ready to